{"id":"14df766fdbba4698","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-rel-field.md","title":"ZFC Rel Field","display":"df-zfc-rel-field — ZFC Rel Field","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rel-field","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rel-field"],"display":"df-zfc-rel-field — ZFC Rel Field","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-rel-domain.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rel-field"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rel-field</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rel-field — ZFC Rel Field"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97c28eede56ea5e4\" href=\"?note=97c28eede56ea5e4\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-rel-domain.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-rel-domain.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9a8f01bfcbcdc014\" href=\"?note=9a8f01bfcbcdc014\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,F,D,Y\\in V\">\\(R,F,D,Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S\\)</span> (relation-domain predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"97c28eede56ea5e4\" href=\"?note=97c28eede56ea5e4\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-rel-domain.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-rel-domain.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S\\)</span> (relation-range predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9a8f01bfcbcdc014\" href=\"?note=9a8f01bfcbcdc014\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> (domain and range witnesses)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelField}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelField}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}field} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelField}_S(F,R)\\leftrightarrow \\exists D\\,\\exists Y\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S(D,R)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S(Y,R)\\land F=D\\cup Y\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}field} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelField}_S(F,R)\\leftrightarrow \\exists D\\,\\exists Y\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S(D,R)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S(Y,R)\\land F=D\\cup Y\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The field is the set union of the canonical domain and range, avoiding an unbounded class-comprehension notation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-rel-domain.md","status":"resolved","id":"97c28eede56ea5e4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-rel-domain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md","status":"resolved","id":"9a8f01bfcbcdc014","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-rel-domain.md","status":"resolved","id":"97c28eede56ea5e4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S$ (relation-domain predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-rel-domain.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md","status":"resolved","id":"9a8f01bfcbcdc014","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S$ (relation-range predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-rel-range.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,F,D,Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelField}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}field} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelField}_S(F,R)\\leftrightarrow \\exists D\\,\\exists Y\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S(D,R)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelRange}_S(Y,R)\\land F=D\\cup Y\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1037,"backlinks":[{"id":"a794056ae8bcbcb9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3310","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-rel-field.md|58-df-zfc-rel-field]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","97c28eede56ea5e4","9a8f01bfcbcdc014"]}